WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.425
So, four decisions.

2
00:00:01.425 --> 00:00:06.372
Adopt the sequence as policy: the
governor secured and live before traffic,

3
00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:09.324
the boundary change
decided before cutover,

4
00:00:09.324 --> 00:00:14.350
and CISA telemetry parity confirmed
before any MTIPS or MPLS circuit ends.

5
00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:19.912
Put the target attributes in writing
for every BOD 26-02 replacement,

6
00:00:19.912 --> 00:00:24.987
before the August 2027 deadline
spends the money like for like.

7
00:00:24.987 --> 00:00:29.175
Decide the Microsoft 365
Optimize exception with tenant

8
00:00:29.175 --> 00:00:32.838
restrictions v2 from the
device as a precondition.

9
00:00:32.838 --> 00:00:34.518
And name one decider per row,

10
00:00:34.518 --> 00:00:38.100
from the authorizing official
to the contracting officer.

11
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.900
The next step needs no award:

12
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:44.047
write the application-to-path policy
that SC-7(4) already asks for,

13
00:00:44.047 --> 00:00:48.429
and instrument a sample of branches
before the next migration wave,

14
00:00:48.429 --> 00:00:51.637
because that baseline
can't be rebuilt afterward.

15
00:00:51.637 --> 00:00:54.676
Buy transport on physics
and govern it as compliance,

16
00:00:54.676 --> 00:00:57.576
and the branch gets faster
without getting weaker.

17
00:00:57.576 --> 00:01:03.362
The Federal Modernization Workbook's Book
09 has the detail, every claim footnoted.

18
00:01:03.362 --> 00:01:04.180
Thank you.
